      "updated": 1790445501136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Object.create()\n\nThis creates a new object whose [[Prototype]] points to animal. which\nmeans it is refrence and if we chnage dog.sound = bark it will also get\nchange in the animal. now animal have its own [[Prototype]] which it\nget from Object.prototype (.toString() , .valueOf() and etc... )",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Object.create()\n\nThis creates a new object whose [[Prototype]] points to animal. which means it is refrence and if we chnage dog.sound = bark it will also get change in the animal. now animal have its own [[Prototype]] which it get from Object.prototype (.toString() , .valueOf() and etc... )",
      "autoResize": false,
