      "versionNonce": 1717848397,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790445501099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "now here the output will be A B D and C. First new Promise() is\nnot a Web API, and .then() is not a Web API either.\nPromise itself is a JavaScript object; .then() registers a callback,\nand that callback is scheduled as a microtask. setTimeout() uses\nthe browser's timer Web API and its callback becomes a task.",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "now here the output will be A B D and C. First new Promise() is not a Web API, and .then() is not a Web API either.\nPromise itself is a JavaScript object; .then() registers a callback, and that callback is scheduled as a microtask. setTimeout() uses the browser's timer Web API and its callback becomes a task.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Avb_NgGBkyP6eQvQeLjB9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10388.258540508128,
