    },
    {
      "id": "w7oDPXWgOr6nHnhulhEOx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7387.450949636131,
      "y": -324.68907342782927,
      "width": 2120.290899470891,
      "height": 45.49999999999994,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b24",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1642192685,
      "version": 3237,
      "versionNonce": 1185494467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790447753213,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“Binding” simply means the connection between a variable name and its value/location in an environment.",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "“Binding” simply means the connection between a variable name and its value/location in an environment.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YUHqkbg0AZ_VR-g76O5_8",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 7363.64588995551,
      "y": -668.9735136335513,
      "width": 1020.1598433738418,
      "height": 137.4878495112995,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 735813059,
      "version": 180,
      "versionNonce": 1138458189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790447820168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uI1f9mg07047aT86WjUhl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7369.117616302797,
      "y": -988.0224067611624,
      "width": 1018.6242328042288,
      "height": 636.9999999999992,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b27",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 62533636,
      "version": 3075,
      "versionNonce": 1172311821,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790447823872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hoisting does not literally mean: \"JavaScript physically\nmoves the code to the top.\"\n\nDuring the creation/setup phase of an execution\ncontext, JavaScript creates bindings for declarations\nbefore executing the code.\n\nThe engine does the environment setup before executing\nthe code line by line. That environment is the Lexical\nEnvironment, which contains the variable bindings.\n\nNow they get declare but get initialized when the code\nget start executing and the time between declaration\nand execution is called the TDZ (Temporal Dead Zone)",
      "fontSize": 36.399999999999956,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hoisting does not literally mean: \"JavaScript physically moves the code to the top.\"\n\nDuring the creation/setup phase of an execution context, JavaScript creates bindings for declarations before executing the code.\n\nThe engine does the environment setup before executing the code line by line. That environment is the Lexical Environment, which contains the variable bindings.\n\nNow they get declare but get initialized when the code get start executing and the time between declaration and execution is called the TDZ (Temporal Dead Zone)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
